																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"714542561332561957","clan_steamid":"103582791475803217","event_name":"Pixel Chaos is OUT NOW! Tidy Up Solo or in 1\u20134 Player Co-op","event_type":10,"appid":5149240,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793391300,"rtime32_end_time":1793395801,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"The museum doors are open! Play solo or restore the exhibits together in online co-op for up to 4 players.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"M\u00fczenin kap\u0131lar\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131! Tek ba\u015f\u0131na oyna ya da 4 ki\u015fiye kadar \u00e7evrim i\u00e7i co-op ile arkada\u015flar\u0131nla birlikte d\u00fczenle.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Tidy up solo or with friends in 1\u20134 player online co-op! Gather colorful cubes, restore pixel art and voxel sculptures. Celebrate launch with 20% off for the first 14 days.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Tek ba\u015f\u0131na veya 1\u20134 ki\u015filik \u00e7evrim i\u00e7i co-op ile m\u00fczeyi toparla! Renkli k\u00fcpleri topla, piksel tablolar\u0131 ve voxel heykelleri tamamla. \u0130lk 14 g\u00fcn boyunca %20 \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f indirimi!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"e58f43f8b5e5f27e5f07a9d6991e51d2cabe464a.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"e58f43f8b5e5f27e5f07a9d6991e51d2cabe464a.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"714542561332561958","clanid":"46281809","posterid":"0","headline":"Pixel Chaos is OUT NOW! Tidy Up Solo or in 1\u20134 Player Co-op","posttime":1793391308,"updatetime":1793391308,"body":"[h1]The museum doors are open \u2014 bring your friends![\/h1]\n\nPixel Chaos: Tidy Up the Museum is out now on Steam! Play solo or team up in [b]online co-op for up to 4 players[\/b] to turn colorful chaos into art.\n\nStep into a Victorian museum overrun with colorful cubes. Gather the scattered pieces, guide them into place, and watch the cluttered halls become an art gallery again.\n\n[h2]Your museum, your pace \u2014 solo or together[\/h2]\nEnjoy a quiet tidying session on your own, or invite your friends and restore the museum as a team. With [b]1\u20134 player support[\/b], you can share the satisfying work of bringing each exhibit back to life.\n\n[h2]From chaos to art, one cube at a time[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Play solo or with friends in online co-op for up to 4 players.\n[*]Collect and stack thousands of colorful cubes.\n[*]Complete pixel paintings and reveal the pictures hidden within.\n[*]Rebuild charming 3D voxel sculptures.\n[*]Unlock magical tools to speed up collecting and tidying.\n[*]Explore grand halls and unwind at your own pace.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Celebrate launch with 20% off[\/h2]\nTo celebrate the opening, the game is 20% off for the first 14 days after launch!\n\nThank you to everyone who wishlisted the game, tried the demo, and shared feedback. Your support helped us bring this museum to life.\n\nWhich exhibit did you restore first? Share your solo creations or co-op moments with us in the Steam Community.\n\n[url=https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/app\/5149240\/]Step inside \u2014 and bring your tidying crew![\/url]\n\nSurprisia Games","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1878895840_1793392687_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"563671973817148249","event_gid":"714542561332561957","voteupcount":1,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"563671973817148249","rtime32_last_modified":1793404341,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793392687,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793390271,"votes_up":1,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"563671973817148248","gidfeature2":"563671973817148249"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["714542561332561958"],"last_update_event":[]}};
						</script>
					

